---
// お知らせカード（トップ・一覧ページ共通）
// highlight のときだけ本文と「お申し込みはこちら」「詳細」ボタンを表示する。
const { item } = Astro.props
const bg = item.ended ? '#F5F3EF' : item.highlight ? '#FFF6F0' : '#FFFFFF'
const border = item.ended
  ? '1px solid rgba(160, 143, 120, 0.2)'
  : item.highlight
    ? '1.5px solid rgba(224, 96, 74, 0.45)'
    : '1px solid rgba(160, 143, 120, 0.16)'
const shadow = (!item.ended && item.highlight) ? '0 8px 24px rgba(224, 96, 74, 0.12)' : 'none'
---
<article class="news-card" style={`position: relative; background: ${bg}; border: ${border}; border-radius: 14px; padding: 26px 26px 24px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px; box-shadow: ${shadow}; transition: transform 0.2s, box-shadow 0.2s; cursor: pointer;`}>
  <a href={item.detailLink} aria-label={item.title} style="position: absolute; inset: 0; border-radius: 14px;"></a>
  {item.ended && (
    <div style="position: absolute; top: 0; right: 0; background: #A08F78; color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.06em; padding: 8px 18px; border-radius: 0 14px 0 12px; pointer-events: none;">開催終了</div>
  )}
  <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;">
    <time style="font-family: Jost, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 500; color: #A08F78; letter-spacing: 0.06em;">{item.date}</time>
    <span style={`font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; color: ${item.ended ? '#FFFFFF' : item.highlight ? '#FFFFFF' : '#A08F78'}; background: ${item.ended ? '#B0A090' : item.highlight ? '#E0604A' : '#F3EBDC'}; padding: 3px 10px; border-radius: 999px; letter-spacing: 0.08em;`}>{item.tag}</span>
  </div>
  <div style="display: flex; align-items: flex-start; justify-content: space-between; gap: 12px;">
    <h3 style="margin: 0; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.6; color: #33291F;">{item.title}</h3>
    {!item.highlight && (
      <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="18" height="18" fill="none" stroke="#A08F78" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" style="flex-shrink: 0; margin-top: 4px;"><path d="M5 12h14 M13 6l6 6-6 6"></path></svg>
    )}
  </div>
  {item.highlight && <p style={`margin: 0; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.9; color: ${item.ended ? '#9A8E82' : '#6B5F4E'};`}>{item.body}</p>}
  {item.highlight && !item.ended && (
    <div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 10px; margin-top: 4px; position: relative; z-index: 1;">
      {item.applyLink && (
        <a href={item.applyLink} class="btn-instagram" style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 7px; font-size: 13.5px; font-weight: 700; color: #FFFFFF; background: #E0604A; text-decoration: none; padding: 11px 20px; border-radius: 999px; transition: background 0.2s;">
          お申し込みはこちら
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="14" height="14" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 5v14 M6 13l6 6 6-6"></path></svg>
        </a>
      )}
      <a href={item.detailLink} class="btn-outline" style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 7px; font-size: 13.5px; font-weight: 700; color: #E0604A; background: #FFFFFF; border: 1.5px solid rgba(224, 96, 74, 0.4); text-decoration: none; padding: 10px 18px; border-radius: 999px; transition: border-color 0.2s, background 0.2s;">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="15" height="15" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="M12 16v-4 M12 8h.01"></path></svg>
        詳細
      </a>
    </div>
  )}
</article>
